.TH FL-LAUNCHER 1 "November 2026" "fldesktop 0.1.0" "fldesktop"
.SH NAME
fl-launcher \- application menu of the fldesktop desktop
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBfl-launcher\fR
.SH DESCRIPTION
A searchable list of the installed applications, grouped by category. Type to
search, Enter starts the selected application (or runs the text as a command when nothing
matches), Escape closes. Starting it while it is open closes it.
.SH SEE ALSO
\fBfl-wm\fR(1), \fBfl-session\fR(1), \fBfl-panel\fR(1)
